{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124190","id":4749206460,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABGxMjvA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124190","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124190.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124190.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124190","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124190/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124190/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124190/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e0668cb4f656bbda8292a7b61d04731f5fb43767","number":124190,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Script Editor: Improve diagnostic list with custom list style (WIP)","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Supersedes #123434 and addresses the same issues brought up there\r\n  - Makes the diagnostic list use a more modern UI than just a RichTextLabel with \"hyperlinks\"\r\n  - Lays groundwork for integration with other PRs (see bottom of other PR's post)\r\n  - Addresses comment here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123310#pullrequestreview-5161094512 (although I have had this prototype on my to-do list for a while before the comment was made)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThis PR takes a slightly different approach to the problem #123434 attempts to address in making the list of diagnostics feel more \"native\" to the Godot editor. Rather than placing all of the diagnostics in a Tree view, which only allows one line of text for each diagnostic with no wrapping, this PR uses a custom node setup for each one so that long warning and error messages can be wrapped across multiple lines. It also allows for some fancier formatting:\r\n- Text of the diagnostics is aligned to each other\r\n- Warning titles are bolded\r\n- Line and column information is displayed in the regular text color, instead of in the warning/error color unlike the rest of the text\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2145\" height=\"1886\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-09-14 at 10 03 40 AM@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc576771-15ff-4514-bbb2-c59913f8a334\" />\r\n\r\nNote that (at least as it currently is) the rows here are notably thicker than in #123434 even when the message is only one line long. I can look into addressing this in the future if it is a concern; personally I like the additional spacing, but I recognize I have a lot of screen real estate and it might be more of an issue for small screens.\r\n\r\nI think both the approach here and in #123434 have pros and cons to them, so I'm posting both for discussion purposes. If we decide we prefer one over the other, I can close the less-preferred one and focus on continuing to improve the other.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/